Third-party code in this directory
----------------------------------

The image-sending driver shipped here is compiled from Tencent's official
openclaw-weixin project (https://github.com/Tencent/openclaw-weixin,
version 2.4.10 at the time of compilation). It is used verbatim from the
official source, compiled locally, and copied here as a build artifact only
(no package install is run on the deployment machine).

